title: Pamphlet
---
<<cameraIndex 7>>
<<if $EmployeetimesVisited == 0>>
    Hii!
    Welcome to Pawperdine College!!
    Are you lost?
    Here! 
    Take a pamphlet!
    Here you’ll find all our resources available!
<<elseif $EmployeetimesVisited == 1>>
    Hi again!!
    Did you find everything ok?
    oh, you want another?
    Here ya go!
<<elseif $EmployeetimesVisited == 2>>
    Uh haha, you already have two pamphlets!
    What do you need all these for?
<<elseif $EmployeetimesVisited == 3>>
    Sure. Take another.
    I don’t care.
<<elseif $EmployeetimesVisited > 3>>
    Seriously.
    I DON’T HAVE TIME FOR THIS.
    PLEASE LEAVE THE BOOTH.
    ALL INFO AND RESOURCES ARE FOUND ON THE
    4 PAMPHLETS YOU HAVE.
<<endif>>
<<set $EmployeetimesVisited to $EmployeetimesVisited+1>>
<<startAction Pamphlet>>
<<cameraIndex 0>>
===



title: card
